  "description": "*\"Make sure... your future husband... is ridiculously handsome...!\"*\n\nSuch was the dying wish of Leah's mother. So when the occasion presents itself to fulfill that promise by marrying the neighboring kingdom's hunky ruler, Leah doesn't think twice. Sure, Fritan is a cold and desolate land, but who cares? Her new husband is total eye-candy! Now, it's up to this unlikely queen to navigate foreign politics, budding romance, and her newfound, mysterious powers... All while enjoying the view!\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
